#
# File: 600-LIFX-udp-dport56700-in-req-accept.rule
# Policy: Allow remote LIFX client request to local LIFX server
# Called by: zones/red/inet-filter-input-red-udp.chain
# Description:
#  LIFX LAN protocol used by WiFi lightbulbs (and Alexa Echo devices probing for it)

udp dport 56700 counter accept comment "remote-to-local LIFX/UDP/56700 request"
